  "releaseNotes": "Entity.Code is now generated as UUID version 7, so an indexed public identifier sorts in creation order instead of scattering inserts across the index. CreatedBy defaults to \"System\", SoftDelete and Activate are idempotent and default their actor, Activate records the reactivation as an update, and IsDeleted reads the soft delete state directly. See CHANGELOG.md.",
